.zone/aW1nLzMwNDg1NzA4LmdpZg==/original/Cbqd1X.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>In a dystopian world of corruption and lies, dominated by corporations, there is only one way to collect the information you seek: the Uppercute sisters&#x27; style.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Uppercute is a fast-paced 3D platformer with combat elements. You will need to navigate through people’s minds to obtain information. The mind can be a very hostile place...\r\n  </p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNDg1NzIwLmdpZg==/original/%2F352zs.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Features\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Gameplay focused on speed, with the challenge of improving to overcome various obstacles.</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_848739\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"03 October 2026 @ 04:02 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 3 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div class=\"aggregate_rating\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tooltip=\"3.50 average rating from 2 total ratings\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://s